    {
     "kind": "explain",
     "tool": null,
     "params": null,
     "text": "Partial months are left out because a month that is still in progress has fewer requests than a full month, which can make the data look like a drop that isn't real. For example, a forecast was made for July 2026 when only about 70% of the month's requests had been recorded, which affected the accuracy of later predictions. Since then, every tool checks completeness first to avoid this issue.",
